  "Items.Water_Bowl.description": "Can be placed inside animal buildings so animals can drink water even if the building does not come with a trough.",
  
  /*
    {{days}} - The number of days (>1) that the animal hasn't had water.

    Thirsty.today / Thirsty.multipleDays: the animal has no water AND is due for it.
    Will lose friendship tonight unless the player provides water.
    
    NoWaterButNotThirstyYet: the animal has no water available, but its water interval has not elapsed yet, so it will NOT be penalized tonight. 
    Just a heads up, not an alarm.
    
    WasLeftThirsty: the animal has water now, but was penalized last night. There to explain the friendship loss the player already took.
    Note: only shows up if animal HAS HAD water today (either thru a trough/bowl or drank outside), since the statuses above have more priority.
  */
